		""
		"{\"text\":\"看看\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"母岩种植产线\",\"color\": \"light_purple\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"23E9F605F87F3827\"},\"underlined\":true},\"以获得无限的赛特斯石英！\"]}"
		""
