		""
		"{\"text\":\"现在\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"净化之水桶\",\"color\": \"green\"},\"也能够直接通过炼金合成，你会在终局的\",{\"text\":\"超级锭\",\"color\": \"light_purple\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"74A13E2EA7987D41\"},\"underlined\":true},\"产线中用到它。\"]}"
